MATH_0016> coming from\nthe computation of <MATH_0017> as a colimit we obtain the desired arrow.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3227fe15015fcd7b4be2de28553010362f96e7a6bb8284ff5b8c71fca2111230", "unit_id": "tag:08Q6:statement"}
